        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=Classify this customer message into exactly one category: Booking, Pricing, General Inquiry, or Complaint.\n\nAlso separately determine if the message contains a genuine complaint or negative feedback — meaning the customer is expressing dissatisfaction, frustration, or describing something that went wrong (e.g. bad service, long wait, rude staff, unmet expectations).\n\nA plain factual question (e.g. asking about price, availability, or how to book) is NOT a complaint, even if it sounds curt or is written in a language other than English. Only mark \"yes\" if there is clear dissatisfaction or a negative experience being described. When in doubt, mark \"no\".\n\nExamples:\n- \"How much is a manicure?\" → Contains Complaint: no\n- \"كم سعر المانيكير؟\" (How much is a manicure?) → Contains Complaint: no\n- \"Your stylist was rude to me\" → Contains Complaint: yes\n- \"😡😡😡\" → Contains Complaint: yes\n\nReply in exactly this format, nothing else:\nCategory: <category>\nContains Complaint: <yes or no>\n\nMessage: {{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.message.text }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
